WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.035
-So one thing we were talkin
about recently at the show

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:04.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
is how people always make
such a big deal about babies

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are born on a special date
or special time.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, the first baby
of the new year,

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:12.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first baby of the
new millennium, you know?

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
If there's a baby born at 11:1
on 11/11.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:19.085
But we realized you never
check back in with them.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, you talk about i
when they're born

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then never again --
until now.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're really excited
about this.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.259 line:92%
Please welcome Bryce Tinsley

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:30.663
a baby born exactly at 8:00 A.M.
on 08/08/88.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.900 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.268 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
How are you?

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:38.872 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, Bryce, thank you so much
for making the time.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:44.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
You, for a moment,
were a very famous baby.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.613 line:92%
You were born on 08/08/88.

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:47.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, that must have bee
awesome.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:51.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it's every man's dream,
peaking at age zero.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.453 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:56.489
-Well, you know, they do say
it's supposed to be good luck.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you found that to be
the case?

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.627 line:92%
-Oh, kind of the exact opposite.

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:03.830
I think I'm the first baby whose
dad died in childbirth.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wait,
how did your dad --

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:07.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I don't want
to hear it.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Neither did the local paper
-Yeah, um...

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:13.973
So you're saying your specia
birthday has been bad luck

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:15.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, it hasn't been
all bad luck.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like just this morning
I was on the subway and --

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:27.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter continues,
applause ]

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ow.
-Ow?

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:32.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just ow? A studio light
fell on your head.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:33.226 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'm -- I'm fine.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:35.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm glad it was just
a studio light this time.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:36.830 line:92%
-Well, I mean, I'm pretty sure

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:37.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
you have a lawsuit
on your hands.

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:40.767
-Oh, no, no, Seth, please do not
sue me for breaking your light

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just finished settling
with that restaurant

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
that gave me hepatitis.
-No, no, no, no. I meant -

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:45.605 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
I meant that you would
be the plaintiff.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh!
Oh, no, no, no, no, no.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:52.979
Jurors say I have defendan
face, whatever that means.

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:55.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
It's fine though, I'm just -

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.884 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.884 --> 00:02:00.320 line:92%
-Oh, my God, another light

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This stinks.
-Do you --

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you need anything,
Bryce?

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.192
Can I get you anything?
-No, I just need a drink.

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:07.360 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay. Great.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is this water?
I'm allergic to water!

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:12.232 line:92%
-You're allergic to water?

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.199 line:92%
-Oh, you know what, it's fine.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have like 20 minutes
till something bad happens

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
Well, man, this is really proo

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
that being born on 08/88
does not sound like

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:21.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's as blessed a birthday
as everyone would say.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.711
-Ah, I mean, it's not all bad.
I got my picture in the paper.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:30.016
-Yeah, that's right. We actually
have the paper right here.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:33.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:35.088 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-That's what that says?

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:37.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait, you never read
this article?

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:39.559 line:92%
-I was a baby when it came out

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:41.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I guess that's --
Whoa!

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:44.197 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:47.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Groaning ]

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.302 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:52.572 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I cannot tell you

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:55.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
how sorry I am about this,
Bryce.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's fine.
Comedy comes in threes, so..

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's true, so you'r
probably safe. Oh!

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-A fourth one?

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:02.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A fourth one.
This is Bryce Tinsley,

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:06.019
the not so lucky born --
born on 08/08/88, everyone

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.854
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Can I stay here tonight?

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:08.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No!
-Please!

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:11.224
-We'll be right back, everybody.
-I have nowhere to go.

